### Request : Create Hardware Category
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/category/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_type": "HARDWARE"
}

### Request 2: Create Digital Category
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/category/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_type": "DIGITAL"
}

### Request 3: Create Luxury & Cosmetics Category
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/category/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_type": "OTHERS"
}

### Request 4: Create Second Category under OTHERS Choice
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/category/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_type": "OTHERS"
}

### Delete Category by product_type
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/category/HARDWARE/

### Product 1: Hardware (Mechanical Keyboard)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/c/product/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Keychron K2 Pro Wireless Mechanical Keyboard",
  "description": "QMK/VIA wireless custom mechanical keyboard with hot-swappable switches and RGB backlighting.",
  "brand": "Keychron",
  "category": "7781acf4-de4f-4b86-92f2-0e2b5e901705"
}

### Product 2: Digital (Software License)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/c/product/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "DevSuite Pro - 1 Year Merchant License",
  "description": "Single-user annual license key for DevSuite Pro, including all minor/major version updates and priority API access.",
  "brand": "DevSuite",
  "category": "e0c461b4-69d6-4ea3-ab69-d70cac8b8436"
}

